{
  "id": 127239522,
  "iid": 5175,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Hide expert info of packet comments in packet tree",
  "description": "The expert info shown for each packet comment contributes no useful\ninformation, only (1) that it is a packet comment and (2) its contents.\nThis patch hides the expert info so the protocol tree is cleaner,\nwithout affecting the ability to find packet comments via the expert\ninfo dialog.\n\nThis patch also changes the API of `expert_add_info[_format]()` so they\nreturn the expert info tree they added, to allow them to be hidden.\n\nBefore:\n\n![Screenshot before](/uploads/906a4c8afab388f33d756fad7ac69d20/comments-before.png)\n\nAfter:\n\n![Screenshot after](/uploads/8dbfb9ed7865fb71fec2cdfa34626b18/comments-after.png)\n\nIf needed, the expert info is shown when the preference is enabled which shows hidden protocol info.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-11-22T13:53:16.256Z",
  "updated_at": "2023-08-24T05:38:14.958Z",
