      "title": "Hide expert info of packet comments in packet tree",
      "message": "Hide expert info of packet comments in packet tree\n\nThe expert info shown for each packet comment contributes no useful\ninformation, only that (1) it is a packet comment and (2) its contents.\nThis patch hides the expert info so the protocol tree is cleaner,\nwithout affecting the ability to find packet comments via the expert\ninfo dialog.\n\nThis patch also changes the API of `expert_add_info[_format]()` so they\nreturn the expert info tree they added, to allow them to be hidden.\n",
      "author_name": "David Perry",
      "author_email": "boolean263@protonmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-11-22T08:35:05.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2023-08-24T05:37:56.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/a58873703cc0208bdd88f5abcf64519834fff879"
    }
  ],
